## Reference project — GRG (general plan) sheet set

Folder: `C:\Users\PCZONE.GE\Downloads\wetransfer_19_xref_grg_2026-04-29_1051\`

- Master file: `GRG to PDF.dwg`
- Xrefs in `19_xref_grg\`: `xref_cig`, `xref_cip`, `xref_cis`, `xref_ciw`,
